WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,460
Hurry up and lead me

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,960
I'd like to see it

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:09,960
How is this human going to protect you from me?

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,460
Just take it quickly

5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,460
Just put a paw print on this contract

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,960
I'll help you drive this hairy beast away

7
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,460
You're a human being who doesn't even have ghost energy.

8
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,960
Not even the ghosts of Sakura Country

9
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,460
Sanya style is not enough

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,460
What are you doing to drive him away?

11
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,380
less nonsense

12
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:31,950
Hold on tightly

13
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:32,950
Got the contract

14
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,450
We are a family now

15
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,950
From now on you will be my owner

16
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:36,950
except me

17
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,450
No one can bully you
